From 3c1eb7d92c07f5f259d9314575ecfd33d52884b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: znyrvalt <220587351+znyrvalt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 07:31:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] crossplay: rebuild Bedrock/Geyser package from scratch

Replaces the first pass. tools/crossplay/ is now a pure-stdlib python3
pipeline (no PIL, no numpy, no network) that regenerates the whole package
deterministically from the committed inputs:

- pngio.py: hand-rolled PNG decoder (8-bit gray/RGB/RGBA/palette, 1/2/4/8-bit
  palette expansion, tRNS) and encoder (RGBA, filter 0, level 9) - exactly the
  formats AltarSMP-ResourcePack.zip contains, loud failure for anything else
- javapack.py: read-only view over the pack zip - model parent chains, merged
  textures, declared texture_size, dispatch resolution, animation .mcmeta
  frame math, and the content-catalogue resolver (dispatch, then sibling
  borrow for the copper_diamond armor pieces)
- render.py: rasterizes each custom item's 3D model into a 128x128 icon - one
  orthographic gui view, per-element boxes rotated/scaled by display.gui,
  painter's algorithm over element centroids, barycentric face fill with alpha
- geometry.py: Java element boxes -> Bedrock minecraft:geometry (x mirrored,
  z recentred, single-axis rotations carried as cube rotation/pivot) plus a
  deterministic per-model texture atlas
- generate_custom_content.py: builds geyser/altarsmp-custom-items.json
  (format_version 2 legacy mappings), packs/pack.zip (manifest with uuid5
  identity, 46 item definitions, item_texture.json, 34 attachables +
  geometries + atlases, rendered icons, the 96 ability artwork pngs),
  inventory.json (all 60 Java entries cross-referenced) and README.md

Determinism contract: sorted zip entries, fixed 1980-02-01 timestamps,
fixed compression level, stable JSON key order, no absolute paths, no
timestamps or hostnames. Verified: two clean runs -> identical sha256.

Known issues this first rebuild ships with, caught by its own validator
(29 checks, 2 failed) after seeing the first icons:
- icons for oversized models (pureblade, hyperion, dragonrend, frost_scythe,
  shadowblade) clip at the fixed model-grid projection scale
- face UVs are sampled on a 16x16 basis; models declaring texture_size 32/64
  (the Blockbench convention) sample shifted/wrapped texels
The next two commits fix exactly these.

